# Separation of Concerns — chuzi-shared

This repo is the **shared library** consumed by both `chuzi-web` and `chuzi-mobile`. It is published as `@chuzi/shared`.

## Belongs here

- TypeScript interfaces/types that mirror `chuzi-api` JSON shapes
- API client (`createChuziClient`) — thin HTTP wrappers, no page-level state
- Realm definitions: lexicons (cosmos/wilds/fallback), locale overrides, visual mapping functions (`cosmosMapping`, `wildsMapping`)
- Shared R3F primitives (Star, Tree, Constellation, ConstellationEdge, layout helpers)
- Shared UI primitives (CreditBadge, FilmCard, RealmThemeProvider)
- Content-rating constants, genre lists, and other domain enums

## Does NOT belong here

- Page-level components, routing, or navigation state
- 3D camera controllers or full-scene compositions (those are viewport-specific)
- Form components tied to a specific page flow (CreateInline, PublishForm)
- Direct API calls at import time — the client is instantiated by the consumer

## Conventions

- Every user-visible string must be a lexicon key, added to all three lexicons (cosmos, wilds, FALLBACK_LEXICON) plus locale overrides.
- After any change: `npm run build && npm version patch|minor|major && npm publish`.
- New exports bump **minor**; breaking changes bump **major**; bug fixes bump **patch**.
